step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple mean combination on the full pool to establish a baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to see if weighting improves over the mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full pool to see if it beats the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Try a best_single ETS to see if a single strong model outperforms the robust median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle w1 on the full pool to see if a more sophisticated weighting improves on best_single ETS.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed_mean combination on the full pool to see if trimming outliers improves over median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Try a weighted inverse-error combination on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if focusing on the top performers improves over best_single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the full pool to see if it outperforms the robust median and weighted schemes.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error to see if a smaller, more stable pool improves over the best_single ETS.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a different kind of strategy – a best_single alternative (ARIMA) to see if another strong model can beat ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the small pool1 to see if reducing model set improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if it improves over mean and weighted on that pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

